{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的部分话句压缩后，因果铺垫和心理动机不如X完整，例如S06的孤单、S07对对方也需要自己的推断，以及S10决定不再猜测的原因。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的普通观众，Y的重点加亮、话与感受分层，以及感受按音乐进程出现，让我更容易在有限时间里抓住每段核心，也更容易把细微的音乐变化转化成具体体验。Y反复使用水波、小船、漂浮、靠岸等意象，加上开头与结尾的呼应，使整段经历更像一条连续发展的情感轨迹。X的优势是心理解释更完整，人物每一步为什么这样想、为什么改变，都交代得更充分；这是Y最明显的损失，但综合观看体验，我仍选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "234a0e8c-0d6f-43bc-a679-86ef15cb5518", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T212446531710Z", "elapsed_seconds": 26.516, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T21:25:13.078788+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ecdc65fbd2b5544d7dc00c9623fed64aae070567677bccba011e8be8d96cc525", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", 